Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Could this have happened\Nwhile we were sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.46,0:00:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,To me and Giorno?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.90,0:00:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista and Trish?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.44,0:00:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of messed up\Nvoodoo crap is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.96,0:00:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Last I checked, people's minds\Ncouldn't just trade bodies?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.30,0:00:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay your hands for now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.72,0:00:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, that can't be a stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.88,0:00:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Zipperman?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.38,0:00:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't no doubt!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.92,0:00:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.84,0:00:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,In my eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.76,0:00:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to turn back on my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.32,0:00:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.23,0:00:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.10,0:00:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,turn back on my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.10,0:01:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Nessun può Star un destino scelto,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.28,0:01:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Roman solo il risultato,\Nche voi sarete distrutti.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,L 'eterna Zoom esiste solo per me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.34,0:01:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,puoi cantare canzoni di\Ntrastezza nel Monday senza tempo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.10,0:02:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank God!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.72,0:02:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad to have you back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.08,0:02:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You even beat the boss to the\Npunch and tracked down the arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.24,0:02:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that cadence.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.20,0:02:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how Narancia\Nspeaks, if memory serves.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.18,0:02:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.04,0:02:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.24,0:02:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought so. And you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.36,0:02:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Giorno.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.36,0:02:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm Trish.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.78,0:02:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Impressive work, Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.94,0:02:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears you've already\Npieced together what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.54,0:02:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.90,0:02:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you the man we were\Nsupposed to meet with?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.10,0:03:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Jean-Pierre Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.50,0:03:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I died by Diavolo's hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.76,0:03:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,However, after switching\Nsouls with this turtle,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.76,0:03:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I was able to maintain a presence here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.04,0:03:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,like a ghost might haunt\Nthe plane of the living.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.56,0:03:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And that over there is my stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.54,0:03:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,With the Eros' power, he was\Ntransformed into Chariot Requiem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.94,0:03:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He is responsible for our displaced souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.22,0:03:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.13,0:03:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,if my soul's in this body, then it's only\Nnatural to conclude the boss is inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.70,0:03:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, don't worry about\Nhim, he hasn't moved at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.64,0:03:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Guy's sleeping like a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.60,0:03:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Might you be, Mista?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.18,0:03:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm really glad to\Nsee you're okay, old buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.34,0:03:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, number seven's\Ngot his eye on your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.50,0:03:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's so much as twitches,\Nwe'll know immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.78,0:03:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Again, he's out cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.40,0:03:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Might be a while before he gets up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.80,0:03:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.71,0:03:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Chariot Requiem's back on his feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.08,0:04:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We've already learned\Nhow to use the arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.34,0:04:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If we can just grab it,\Nthis'll all be over!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.56,0:04:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this, Zippermann?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.30,0:04:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.24,0:04:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, the arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.08,0:04:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Requiem's going for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.52,0:04:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Not on my watch, you little bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.92,0:04:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait, something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.40,0:04:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Miseria, did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.16,0:04:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill you, you stupid ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.26,0:04:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That thick skull of yours is about to\Nbecome holier than a dog shit-eating priest!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.94,0:04:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The pillar next to you! Mesa! Doc!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.46,0:04:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Spicy lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.42,0:05:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Die, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.32,0:05:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna blast your\Nugly head open and paint
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.56,0:05:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,the streets with your\Nchunky noodle juices!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.24,0:05:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll number one cut the shit out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.56,0:05:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you think\Nyou're doing, you moron?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.90,0:05:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.26,0:05:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.46,0:05:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What was I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.08,0:05:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.20,0:05:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.14,0:05:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys! Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.14,0:05:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Requiem!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.05,0:05:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going for the arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.30,0:05:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't just let him take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.76,0:05:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you gotta be freaking kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.06,0:05:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,How did all that just happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.60,0:05:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were to guess,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.44,0:05:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a result of his frenetic state.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.84,0:05:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even I have seen chariots show\Nsuch terrifying powers before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.54,0:05:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But this much is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.38,0:05:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,In response to my subconscious\Nwill, he's become a defensive stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.00,0:06:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as he lives, he'll\Nallow no one to touch the arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.66,0:06:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,To turn stands against their users.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.12,0:06:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a cunning defense mechanism\Nwill prove challenging to defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.64,0:06:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So not only can the arrow control all\Nour minds, it can pull tricks like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.24,0:06:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to get at it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.32,0:06:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude is out of control!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.80,0:06:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.71,0:06:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,our stands might be supercharged,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.14,0:06:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,but that just means if we try to grab the\Narrow right now, we'll get roasted alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.84,0:06:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad Benedict!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.04,0:06:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No howling! You pipe down!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.48,0:06:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, there, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.26,0:06:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.76,0:06:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mista!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.12,0:06:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's making number\Nseven lose his barbles!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.82,0:06:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever's inside, Bucciarati,\Nthey're coming too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.24,0:06:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,My god, is it him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.34,0:06:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We can worry about the arrow later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.16,0:07:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Get into place and don't\Ntake your eyes off him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.80,0:07:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Mista, take a shot and make it count!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.68,0:07:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.96,0:07:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Put those bullets of yours to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.56,0:07:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.86,0:07:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But, dude, did you forget that's\Nyour body I'd be shooting at?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.40,0:07:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.30,0:07:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Golden Wind can patch up\Nbullet wounds without effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.52,0:07:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So, shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.56,0:07:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,All we gotta do is incapacitate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.54,0:07:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That was your plan, right, Bucerati?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.80,0:07:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, he's on the move!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.34,0:07:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.60,0:07:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That should do it, fellas!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.06,0:07:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think he'll be\Ncharging at us any time soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.82,0:07:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's showing up on my radar!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.04,0:07:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like there won't be\Nany backup to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.86,0:07:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.16,0:08:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we get the arrow,\Nthis'll all be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.08,0:08:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, when we're back in\NNapoli, it's off to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.10,0:08:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hot damn, I'm already psyched.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.84,0:08:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The first thing I'll do is stuff my\Nface with an authentic margarita slice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.88,0:08:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Might even top it with porcini's.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.28,0:08:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,After that...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.34,0:08:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If I ever see Fugo again, he can\Ncall me a kagakatsu all he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.24,0:08:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't give two shits.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.50,0:08:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And even though Bakio's gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.14,0:08:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Trish!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.05,0:08:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll protect you till my dying breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.04,0:08:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.62,0:08:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.53,0:08:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista, just to be safe,\Ntake out both of his legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.72,0:08:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.86,0:08:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Trish, would you mind\Nhanding me my bullets?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.50,0:08:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I want them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.48,0:08:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Just reach down into\Nmy boot and grab them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.68,0:08:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.44,0:09:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, pick up the pace, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.28,0:09:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Those legs won't shoot themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.96,0:09:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.06,0:09:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Time jumped, just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.72,0:09:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We skipped a few seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.16,0:09:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, the bullets\Nthat fell on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.42,0:09:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Did anyone actually hear them land?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.16,0:09:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.20,0:09:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I was watching him closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.78,0:09:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Not once did I catch him move,\Nlet alone evoke Emperor Crimson.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.42,0:09:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It just doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.54,0:09:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What other nefarious forces could\Npossibly be haunting us this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.04,0:09:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Trish.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.95,0:09:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I might need a little favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.00,0:09:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you go ahead and drop\None more bullet for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.88,0:09:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on! Are you deaf?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.62,0:09:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you even count how many of them\Nare rolling around there right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.90,0:09:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The answer's four!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.18,0:09:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The absolute freaking worst!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.48,0:09:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't have that bullshit\Nnumber anywhere near me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.34,0:09:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If they fell while you\Nwere handing them over,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.40,0:10:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,then for the love of God, do me\Na solid and drop another one!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.64,0:10:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How sure are we exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.30,0:10:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Diavolo in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.70,0:10:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Trish, could you just remind me again?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.38,0:10:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,When we all woke up, you said you\Ncouldn't sense the boss anywhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.64,0:10:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.52,0:10:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what about now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.74,0:10:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you picking up anything at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.60,0:10:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That cannot be the case!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.18,0:10:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You swapped with Narancia, and\Naccordingly Mista swapped with Trish.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.52,0:10:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It stands to reason Buterati\Nswapped with Diavolo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.56,0:10:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,With Requiem's powers, they're\Nthe only pairings that work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.36,0:10:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I get what you're saying, but none\Nof that explains why time just jumped.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.26,0:10:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That can only mean whoever's in that\Nbody right now can't possibly be Diavolo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.34,0:10:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia, how does our perimeter look?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.64,0:10:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you able to detect anyone coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.30,0:10:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.20,0:11:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.98,0:11:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one more bullet,\Nplease just drop one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.86,0:11:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You're driving me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.77,0:11:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.69,0:11:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why couldn't I feel a\Nsoul like I usually do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.16,0:11:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.44,0:11:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of the way! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.16,0:11:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me through! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.56,0:11:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.50,0:11:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.66,0:11:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How on earth could he have?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.04,0:11:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Match, scan the area right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.10,0:11:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure there's no one around!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.30,0:11:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.20,0:11:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.11,0:11:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and get him down from there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.80,0:11:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't just leave him like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.28,0:11:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Do something, goddammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.32,0:11:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to settle down!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.54,0:11:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me handle this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.56,0:11:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stay focused and\Nkeep your gun at the ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.66,0:11:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll attack again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.02,0:11:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to find him before he does, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.16,0:11:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Zipperman!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.66,0:12:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Heal him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.76,0:12:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull those jam bars out of\Nthere and get to work now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.16,0:12:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The people outside the\NColiseum are waking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.20,0:12:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.48,0:12:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't sense him at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.84,0:12:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.82,0:12:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What else could have happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.66,0:12:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way in hell he'd\Njust up and vanish like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.50,0:12:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Emperor Crimson's range is\Ntwo or three meters at most.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.06,0:12:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,How then did he attack\Nus from way over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.72,0:12:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, all right. You did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.98,0:12:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Naraj is awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.62,0:12:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, you little bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.88,0:12:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.48,0:12:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez, you really scared us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.28,0:12:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Nista.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.84,0:12:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no one left in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.90,0:12:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.26,0:12:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The physical wounds he\Nsuffered have healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.52,0:13:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But still, Golden Wind\Ncouldn't get to him in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.28,0:13:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He was...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.70,0:13:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He was already gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.86,0:13:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm just...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.18,0:13:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.62,0:13:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,His form is just an\Nempty vessel. Now I can't
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.10,0:13:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,find him his soul has\Nleft there's nothing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.94,0:13:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Try as I might I can't\Nbring him back I wasn't
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.22,0:13:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,fast enough my soul could\Njust slip right back
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.16,0:13:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,in if it wanted it could\Ninhabit both bodies
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.76,0:13:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,without a problem not\Neven one he's that empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.26,0:13:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It was all so sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.76,0:13:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,None of us could have guessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.64,0:14:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.78,0:15:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard, where could he be hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.54,0:15:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This should never have happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.66,0:15:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The only explanation is if\Nthere were two Diavolos.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.94,0:15:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, the child that appeared before him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.56,0:15:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.28,0:15:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Were both of them one physical\Nbody with two different souls?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.10,0:15:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.34,0:15:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Diavolo must have two personalities.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.58,0:15:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the only possible answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.64,0:15:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The one currently inside your body\Nis the young man I met earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.82,0:15:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He and Diavolo may share a physical\Nbody, but their souls are separate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.34,0:15:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The human soul can be a\Nstrange and delicate thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.76,0:15:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A traumatic childhood event\Ncan easily fissure it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.78,0:15:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,As the individual grows, so too do\Nthe fissures until the soul is split.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.88,0:16:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Over time,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.04,0:16:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,the second personality distinguishes\Nitself from the original,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.26,0:16:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,with one of them soon becoming dominant.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.98,0:16:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a well-documented disorder.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.58,0:16:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.82,0:16:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What I'm saying is no mere conjecture.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.76,0:16:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Reports from across Europe\Nconfirm that even one's
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.12,0:16:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,physical form will change as\Nthe personalities alternate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.76,0:16:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Requiem managed to extract these two\Nsouls from the singular body they share.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.60,0:16:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,One of them, the young man's,\Nfound its way into Buterati's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.72,0:16:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The other one, however,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.90,0:16:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,For reasons unknown, it has established\Nitself in a body we haven't found.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.10,0:16:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,that's how diavolo took us by\Nsurprise we didn't think he'd still be
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.60,0:16:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,roaming around in a different\Nvessel this shit hurts my head two
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.20,0:16:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,personalities so that's what the boss\Nhas been hiding as we speak countless
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.64,0:16:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,civilians are awakening the haystack\Nwill soon grow intractably large
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.40,0:17:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm certain he'll pounce on us again\Nand this time he'll finish the job
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.04,0:17:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,that's one scenario however it's\Njust as likely he's nowhere near us
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.04,0:17:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,right now diavolo wants the arrow too\Nwhich is why narancia was the first
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.52,0:17:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,one targeted he's blinded us we've\Nlost our only radar it's enabling
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.60,0:17:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,him to move about freely no one can\Ntrack him not with lil bomber anyway
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.64,0:17:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but even so you must keep your\Nfocus on the Arrow. There's no point.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.52,0:17:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,in going after emperor crimson\Nwithout its power that's precisely why
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.74,0:17:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,we need to locate requiem before he\Ndoes do you remember which way he
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.10,0:17:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,went to the west he's left a trail\Nof people regaining consciousness in
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.40,0:17:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,his wake wait a minute are you really\Nplanning to chase him down right
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.58,0:17:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,now what about your mangled body back\Nthere i avoided his vital organs?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.52,0:17:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll live, but he's not\Ngetting up anytime soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.42,0:17:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I made sure of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.52,0:18:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay put, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.60,0:18:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be safe here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.90,0:18:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let anyone hurt you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.00,0:18:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.28,0:18:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't you worry, when it's\Nover we'll bring you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.94,0:18:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out for anybody\Ncoming near us. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.50,0:18:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Trish what are you doing stay close right
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.56,0:19:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.70,0:19:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're under arrest!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.96,0:19:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here and let me show you\Nhow these cuffs look on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.32,0:19:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.23,0:19:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everything alright back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.74,0:19:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.65,0:19:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a false alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.20,0:19:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy rushed at me so\NI thought he was the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.72,0:19:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But it was just a dumbass cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.70,0:19:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's become increasingly clear to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.62,0:19:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Requiem has neither directional\Nnor emotional objectives.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.50,0:19:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Though we've closed in on him, he\Nhasn't once turned to look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.42,0:19:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no question\Nhe's a living organism.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.28,0:20:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if the resemblance he bears to some\Nrubber figurine would suggest otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.06,0:20:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,In his mind, I've yet to\Neven register as a threat,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.46,0:20:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,but even if I did he can\Nbarely throw a punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.48,0:20:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Still his physical presence is quite real.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.18,0:20:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean he's been seen\Nand touched hasn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.86,0:20:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,it's no good can't even get close it's not\Njust our stands anything we throw at it
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.70,0:20:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,it sends flying right back in our faces\Nthis arrow might really be untouchable it
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.70,0:20:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,doesn't matter how hard you try to reach\Nfor it it's gonna push you back with just
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.58,0:21:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,as much force and here he comes again How
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.16,0:21:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,are we supposed to pick\Nthis damn thing up?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.40,0:21:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like it's mocking us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.86,0:21:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Requiem won't allow stand\Nusers to pick up the arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.40,0:21:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Which leads me to think,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.08,0:21:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,what if a person without the gift\Nwere to go ahead and try their luck?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.54,0:21:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Would they succeed?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.82,0:21:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what are your thoughts?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.40,0:21:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I look like, a stand scientist?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.68,0:21:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell should I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.08,0:21:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.40,0:21:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.60,0:21:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been reduced to a reptile\Nfighting to hold on to its dear soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.72,0:21:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That means I'm no longer a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.34,0:21:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't repel me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.60,0:21:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.51,0:21:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.60,0:21:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Take the arrow and infill your stand now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.70,0:22:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We are the power who'll see the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.38,0:22:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we are the fighters\Njust fighting for a ride!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.70,0:23:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
